WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.826
U ka furu sababu fɛ, u ye dencɛ wolo.

00:00:02.906 --> 00:00:09.659
A bamuso tun ye so min ta ka taga n'a ye o yɔrɔ la, mɔgɔw tun b'a tɔgɔ la ko Ouédraogo.

00:00:09.739 --> 00:00:15.000
A nana kɛ mɔgɔba ye tuma min na, a ye Moha mara fɔlɔ sigi Tenkodogo.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:17.042
Musaw buruju bɔra a le ra.
